findings.actual:
Alba di g05, a mezzogiorno: Gino dice «Da dentro la lanterna è un sole! Un sole che gira!» e Zeno risponde «Mh. Adesso sai perché non dormo.» Subito dopo il bilancio rivela il desiderio «Vedere la lanterna del Faro accesa da dentro».
Dopo:
- g13: «voglio vedere la lanterna del faro da DENTRO»;
- g14: «Ho visto la lanterna! Spenta, però. Di giorno non la accende»;
- g21: «Dentro non mi fa entrare, lo Zeno» / «Dentro ci si va da grandi».
Il Faro, inoltre, ha la luce solo dalle 18 (luogo.faro.descrizione).

Il bilancio annuncia sempre l'oggetto che arriverà la sera dopo:
- g01: «La laguna ha portato una bottiglia… Cara mia» (la bottiglia arriva a g02);
- g04: «L. tesse da sola, col nero di seppia» (L4 arriva a g05);
- g05: «Nel fuso a forma di faro… L.» (il fuso arriva a g06);
- g09: pagina strappata (arriva a g10);
- g15: bottiglia col nodo nero (arriva a g16);
- g16: «Ho letto tre lettere di mia madre» (il fascio arriva a g17).
Le piste arrivano dopo le soluzioni:
- g12: «Dove guardare: …merletto del 1958», dopo il rammendo del 1958;
- g15: «Dove guardare: …Nel 1951 qualcuno gli diede una valigia», dopo l'Archivio 1951;
- nel Taccuino › Domande le piste compaiono sotto le risposte.

Dopo ogni culmine l'alba chiude con una battuta di riserva:
- g11, dopo il nodo («Nessuna delle due ha parlato»): Teresa «Io non dico niente a nessuno, cara…»;
- g14: la scena della lettera manca e si chiude con Teresa «Ah, cara, che giornata!»;
- g16, Ada riceve le 168 lettere della madre: Teresa «Due chiacchiere sulla Fondamenta valgono più di una lettera, cara.»;
- g18, la pace: solo «Trent'anni, Teresa.» / «Trenta…», poi la caramella di Gino e «Ah, cara, che giornata!». Il pagamento «Lo so. Siediti, che il pane è caldo» (g18.alba.pane) non compare;
- g20, Nina resta: Teresa «Due chiacchiere…» e Marta «Il pane è in forno, non ho tempo.»;
- g02: Gino «Ho incontrato tutti, li ho contati: sette!» in un merletto con 4 fili.

Ogni sera compare la stessa frase: «Bussano alla porta. La laguna ha lasciato qualcosa.» Ma gli oggetti non vengono dalla laguna:
- g01: l'ultimo merletto della nonna (già sul tombolo) e il Libro dei Punti di casa;
- g15: la lettera di Clotilde, consegnata da Zeno;
- g17: il fascio che Zeno porta a mano («Sono tue, piccola»);
- g18-g23: i bigliettini di Livia, che il diario dice «sotto la porta»;
- g23: il nastro della nonna.

qa_build.summary:
Part 2 of piattaforma-qa is done. It contains all the end-to-end suites of ARCHITETTURA 15.2 except smoke, in /home/user/claude/gioco/tests/e2e/. They run on the 5 Playwright projects of playwright.config.ts. The 6 tests that fail all fail on defects in other packages; those defects are documented with steps to reproduce.

Suites:
- **prologo.spec.ts**: the campaign prologue played with real drags, not the API. The mouse is used on desktop. On iphone, android and ipad the touch comes from CDP Input.dispatchTouchEvent, which produces pointer events of type 'touch'. Coordinates come from night.layout(). The test goes from «Tocca per iniziare» through the black screen and the grandmother's note, then plays the four rows of GDD 3.15:
  - row 6: Fix the hour with nothing set fails on Marta's pin;
  - row 7: the margin note «Chi sta sopra, dà», a tap flips the crossing, the letter is delivered;
  - row 9: Marta's «No.», the spindle bounces back;
  - the night ends with 4 crossings, night:complete and the three dawn vignettes.
  A drag that does not register on the first try counts as a defect. The file also has a long-press test and a keyboard-only test.
- **campagna.spec.ts** (desktop, iphone): the golden path from g00 to the choice in g23, driven by the content data. Each evening it replies so that desires are revealed, pins the requests that lead to the true ending (checked with engine.solve), plays each night with night.autoplay(), and mends the Archives from the chest. It checks:
  - all 24 days are played;
  - all 49 pinned requests are satisfied;
  - all 6 Archives are mended;
  - the flags lettereLivia=liberate and riconciliate are set;
  - all 8 desires are known;
  - memoria at the end of g22 meets the true-ending requirement;
  - the requirements for ending D are met through play, without forcing flags.
  Then it plays C (back to the g23 evening, not counted as an ending), D (unlocks the Tablecloth), A and B, each with epilogue, credits with the music box, and the end screen. No request leaves localhost.
- **archivio.spec.ts**: arc1 opened from the chest.
  - Naming: confirmation only with 3 correct names.
  - Mending: a legal but wrong mend is rejected with tombolo.archivio.nonCoincide, undo goes back, the recorded mend is accepted.
  - Echo on tap, then the reveal and the updated knowledge.
- **salvataggio.spec.ts**: reload mid-night then «Continua» resumes the same row, draft and dropped requests. A visibilitychange to hidden writes the save immediately. Export/import through the Settings screen restores the save. A corrupted slot loads the other one; two corrupted slots start from zero, with a warning in both cases.
- **giornaliero.spec.ts**: the same date gives the same hash after a reload, in another browser context, and via engine.daily. The share text matches GDD 8.3. An imported score re-weaves the same lace. A score with one altered character is rejected.
- **layout.spec.ts**: a tour of 28 screens in 5 variants (base, text at 140%, high contrast, English, simulated safe area 47/34) on all 5 projects. It takes screenshots and runs a DOM audit for:
  - text overflowing its container or its button;
  - text off screen;
  - targets smaller than 44 px;
  - untranslated i18n keys showing;
  - elements in the safe-area bands; inside scroll containers, both ends of the scroll are checked.
  - A probe test confirms the audit catches real problems.
  The file also has color-blindness checks (deuteranopia, protanopia and tritanopia with the Machado 2009 matrices, plus black and white): simulated screenshots, and a check on the data that any two threads with confusable colours have different motif and icon. It also produces 5 store screenshots each for iPhone 6.9" 1290×2796, iPad 13" 2064×2752 and Android 1080×1920.
- **audio.spec.ts**: state is locked before any gesture, running after the first tap, suspended when the page is hidden, then running again. The sound log for the first prologue row is crossing → hour fixed → bell («ore 6 s=1») → secret. Also tested: «Tocca per continuare», mute, captions, and no audio files downloaded.
- **prestazioni.spec.ts**: frame-time p95 during a drag on 6 columns, heap after 10 days of autoplay, and the build budgets of ARCHITETTURA 16.
- **i18n.spec.ts**: no L1 keys missing in English, and no keys requested but missing after a full screen tour in Italian and in English.
- **rete.spec.ts**: a full run where every request stays on the game's origin, and a test that the game still works offline after the first load.

Shared helpers in tests/e2e/helpers/:
- game.ts: the `game` fixture (network guarded from the first instant, console errors collected, fresh save), call() to reach window.__GAME__, wait helpers, onlyProjects;
- pointer.ts: real mouse and touch input;
- campaign.ts: the golden-path planner;
- audit.ts, tour.ts, shots.ts: the layout audit, the screen tour and the reference screenshots.

Reference screenshots are in tests/e2e/__screenshots__/:
- layout/<project>/base: all 28 screens;
- layout/<project>/<other variants>: the 9 densest screens;
- layout/<project>/daltonismo;
- store/<device>.
That is 355 files, 21 MB. They are rewritten only when missing or with --update-snapshots / E2E_SHOTS=1.

Defects found and fixed by the integration during this work: notifications covered the spindles and swallowed the first drag after Fix the hour.

Report: /home/user/claude/gioco/docs/stato/piattaforma-qa.md. Commit 78ceaa9; earlier versions of my files had already been committed by the orchestrator's snapshots c9012fa, 8edd406 and d31e50b.

acceptance.evidence:
I ran each ci step separately:
- npm run build: exit 0;
- npm test: 75 files, 1010 tests passed;
- levels:check: 34 levels OK;
- native:check: exit 0;
- native:test: 59/59.

The e2e step was E2E_PORT=5291 npm run test:e2e -- --update-snapshots=all, with the config's webServer: 122 passed, 6 failed, 72 skipped by design. Every suite of ARCHITETTURA 15.2 is implemented: prologo, campagna, archivio, salvataggio, giornaliero, layout, audio, prestazioni. I added i18n and rete; smoke belongs to fondamenta.

The section 'Risultati e test che falliscono' in docs/stato/piattaforma-qa.md covers all 6 failures:
- tombolo (3): ghost click when naming Archive threads by touch;
- fondamenta (2): dioramas and fonts not available offline;
- contenuti-atto1 (1): arc3, Teresa and Aldo share the same motif and icon.

Each entry has the error message, the cause and the steps. The same items are in requests_for_others.

