- layout/<5 projects>/<5 variants>/<screen>.jpg;
- layout/<desktop|iphone>/daltonismo/*.jpg;
- store/<iphone-6.9-1290x2796|ipad-13-2064x2752|android-1080x1920>/1-titolo, 2-tombolo-notte, 3-alba-vignetta, 4-taccuino, 5-merletto-del-giorno.jpg.

I looked at several of them myself: title, mid-night g16, dawn with Nina, Taccuino, Merletto del giorno, English and 140% variants.

